ue}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "If you take a longer view of staffing, you will find motivated and talented employees who can provide good customer service and help you maintain profitability for the long term. You have got to establish some hiring practices to make sure you will have a qualified, professional staff.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "17400", "text": "You should examine the recruitment sources that have provided employees who have been effective. You have to determine whether employment agencies have provided you with good employees. Also evaluate whether nearby colleges or online job search sites have resulted in qualified employees. You must track results of all of your recruitment sources and use the best ones to search for employees for your restaurant.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "43000", "text": "If you give preference to someone with restaurant experience, they will understand the flexibility needed in scheduling, and will know how to contribute to a smooth and efficient work flow. If you find someone who has worked in several capacities, from server to kitchen help, you have to consider that applicant seriously. A staff member who can fill in where needed when staff shortages occur can be an invaluable addition to your staff.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "69500", "text": "Ask your current staff to recommend people for new positions. You will also get a lot of help in training if you use this method. A friend will be likely to help another friend learn the ropes.", "id": 4, "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "81000", "text": "You must look for employees that can fit into the overall culture of your restaurant. During the interview, devise questions that address the interviewee's attitude toward work.", "id": 5, "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img03.jpg"}, {"time": "92700", "text": "You have got to write down the types of skills you need in employees. Among these may be things like the ability to positively resolve customer complaints, a knack for efficiency in moving food orders to and from the kitchen, and an ability to work under these pressures. If you ask the people you interview to respond to questions in each of these areas, you will develop a sense of the skill set you will get if you hire that person.", "id": 6, "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le05ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}